gQ4(){return"What produces the day master, same polarity \u2014 support given unevenly. Intuition, unusual learning and a mind that goes its own way; traditionally it can also starve the Eating God."},
gPX(){return"What produces the day master, opposite polarity \u2014 support given steadily. Education, protection and backing; traditionally the mother. It strengthens the day master and softens the pressure on it."},
